# Variance note for MABSplit Phase 0: find_best_split self-share on the
# SAME cell (clic097, e7 1T, quiet box both runs) measured 15.1% (main
# table) vs 25.3% (this addendum) — the split phase's share is highly
# run-sensitive on split-bound photos. Any Hoeffding-style early-stop
# argument must budget for that spread.
